+    Fallback directories can be given with ``fallback_searchpath``. They
+    are only searched when the template is not found in any of the
+    primary ``searchpath`` directories, so a template in a primary
+    directory always wins over one with the same name in a fallback
+    directory.
+
+    .. code-block:: python
+
+        loader = FileSystemLoader("/theme", fallback_searchpath="/defaults")
+
     :param searchpath: A path, or list of paths, to the directory that
         contains the templates.
     :param encoding: Use this encoding to read the text from template
         files.
