+    :param fallback_searchpath: A path, or list of paths, to directories
+        that are searched, in order, after all of ``searchpath`` when a
+        template is not found there.
+    :param path_transform: Optional callable taking a template name and
+        returning the name to actually look up; applied before the
+        search path lookup.
+
